<article class="env-definition" id="08UU">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/08UU">Definition <span data-tag="08UU">92.20.1</span>.</a> Let $f : (X, \mathcal{O}_ X) \to (S, \mathcal{O}_ S)$ be a morphism of ringed spaces. The <em>cotangent complex</em> $L_ f$ of $f$ is $L_ f = L_{\mathcal{O}_ X/f^{-1}\mathcal{O}_ S}$. We will also use the notation $L_ f = L_{X/S} = L_{\mathcal{O}_ X/\mathcal{O}_ S}$. </p>
</article>